# ── Demo-Canada strategic materials — LOCAL ONLY ─────────────────────────────
# Market positioning, prospect-specific strategy, and internal demo preparation
# are not for public repositories. Pattern committed so all contributors apply
# the same boundary. Content stays local. Do not remove these entries without
# security review. Mirrored in `.local-only-patterns` (pre-push hook + CI gate).

# Canadian market materials
docs/CANADIAN_READINESS.md
docs/MARKET_INTELLIGENCE.md
docs/PLAN_*.md
docs/SESSION_REPORT_*.md
docs/CANADIAN_MARKET_IMPACT_BRIEF.md
docs/DEMO_PACKAGE_*.md

